    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Writing Workshop"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<strong>Price – $25 / $35 / $45</strong>\r\n\r\nOur Adult Education Programs are <strong>Pay-What-You-Can.</strong> We offer sliding scale options at PHT that allow you to pick the price that works for you, no questions asked!\r\n\r\n<strong>Create compelling characters!</strong> Whether you’re working on a new project or want to write a story just for fun, strengthen your skills and connect with fellow writers in this supportive workshop. Led by Kimberly Sunder, this session encourages participants to craft complex and nuanced characters that feel real and authentic. Work through various prompts and exercises that allow you to unlock your story, gain confidence in your writing, and have fun in the process! Whether you’re polishing your craft or picking up your pen for the first time, this is an opportunity to spark some new ideas.\r\n\r\nSupplies included.\r\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"></p>"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
