    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Step in time with PHT’s Movie Singalong! Join us for a practically perfect screening of <b><i>Mary Poppins</i></b>, the 1964 classic Disney musical starring Julie Andrews and Dick Van Dyke. Set in Edwardian London, follow along as the titular magical nanny leads the Banks children through fantastical adventures with her friend, Bert, a cockney jack-of-all-trades. Featuring unforgettable tunes such as “A Spoonful of Sugar”, “Supercalifragilisticexpialidocious”, “Let’s Go Fly a Kite”, and more!\r\n\r\nDust off that chimney sweep outfit or come prepared with an umbrella and carpet bag for our pre-movie costume contest! Winner will receive a prize.\r\n\r\nCostumes are not mandatory, but highly encouraged!\r\n\r\n<b>Admission includes a complimentary small bag of popcorn.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Ages: 6+</b>"
      }
    ],
