        "@id": "https://www.phtheatre.org/stec_event/pht-community-clothing-swap-4/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "PHT Community Clothing Swap"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Presentation House Theatre’s Community Clothing Swap returns just in time for the new school year! Join us this September for a fun, sustainable way to refresh your closet for the upcoming months as the leaves start to change colour. Please bring up to 15 gently used clothing items and swap them for something new-to-you. We welcome clothing for all ages, all sizes, and all genders (and Halloween costumes too, if you’re looking to lighten the load ahead of spooky season). And we will have plus size clothing available, so don’t miss out! Admission is by donation (suggested amount: $5)—give what feels right for you and help us keep these community events going strong. We hope to see you there!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2025-09-21T11:00:00-07:00"
