        "@value": "Mozart’s Magic Flute Reimagined"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All of Mozart’s magnificent music, a stunning cast of singers and a whimsical update of the story and setting into our corporate, technical world. Magic not to be missed.\r\n\r\n<strong>For all ages (7+ recommended)</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>A North Shore Light Opera Society Production</strong>\r\n\r\nFor more information, visit <strong><a role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.nslos.com/\">nslos.com</a></strong>"
      }
