        "@id": "https://www.phtheatre.org/stec_event/the-magic-veil-of-reality/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Magic Veil of Reality"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Prepare to be enchanted as ‘The Magic Veil of Reality’ transports you into a world where the extraordinary becomes ordinary. Join us for a live magic experience like no other on October 29th.\r\n\r\nFour unique magicians will astound and amaze you with their distinct styles, creating moments of wonder that defy explanation. In a digital age, this is your chance to witness the Magic up Close and LIVE.\r\n\r\nExperience the thrill, feel the wonder, and be part of the enchantment as ‘The Magic Veil of Reality’ blurs the line between the possible and the impossible.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this immersive journey into the world of magic. Book your tickets now for an unforgettable evening on October 29th.\r\n\r\n<strong>Ages: 19+</strong>"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2023-10-29T19:00:00-07:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2023-10-29T21:00:00-07:00"
      }
    ],
