  {
    "@id": "https://www.phtheatre.org/temporary/2dff64f5-72f0-463c-8cdf-d2071d08a420",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g7974600"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.phtheatre.org/stec_event/the-distance-from-newfoundland-to-toronto/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Distance From Newfoundland to Toronto"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Theresa Madonna Molloy is off the Rock, on a plane and on a mission. She will regale you with hilarious and horrific family secrets, whether you want her to or not. Keep your seatbelts on, it’s bound to get a little turbulent.\r\n\r\nWith a critically acclaimed sold out run in 2015, Dolores Drake returns with a revised version of her solo hit “The Distance Between Newfoundland and Toronto.”\r\n\r\n“Drake takes the chatty Kathy you might meet on any flight and fills her with warmth, humour and emotional depth, offering some darkly poignant epiphanies.”-Vancouver Sun\r\n\r\n“You will laugh out loud in this play, along with almost every other emotion you have, never knowing which one will come up next. Brilliant. Simply put this is a must see.” - Plank Magazine."
      }
    ],
