        "@value": "<p>A joyful theatrical experience for kids (ages 3-7) that explores intergenerational love with warmth, laughter &amp; puppetry. Co-produced by Marionetas de la Esquina and Presentation House Theatre.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.phtheatre.org/learning-forgetting-apr-2022/\">Click here for full show details.</a></p>\r\n"
